abstract: >-
  An open-source platform for Turkish electricity-market data ingestion,
  quality control, time-series analytics, forecasting, anomaly detection,
  visualization and BI-ready exports. Version 1.1.1 preserves the secure
  hosted EPİAŞ integration introduced in 1.1.0 and corrects the package and
  citation version metadata embedded in the archived source.
